(6575246, 980081, 124982, '<td valign="top">Really liked this image....but I am left wondering whether this is street macro or studio macro considering the very controlled (re: ideal) lighting and composition? Of course, I probably am mistaken....but is it my job as a voter to infer the connection to the topic, or your job as the photographer to show the connection? Interesting debate!<br/> <br/>Only reason I write this is because this image is my favorite in the challenge, and I''m very torn as to whether I should give it a 9 or 10...or a much lower score for not adequately conveying the topic. <br/> <br/>Will come back to vote later after giving this some more thought.</td>', 'Really liked this image....but I am left wondering whether this is street macro or studio macro considering the very controlled (re: ideal) lighting and composition? Of course, I probably am mistaken....but is it my job as a voter to infer the connection to the topic, or your job as the photographer to show the connection? Interesting debate! Only reason I write this is because this image is my favorite in the challenge, and I''m very torn as to whether I should give it a 9 or 10...or a much lower score for not adequately conveying the topic.  Will come back to vote later after giving this some more thought.', '2011-10-24 13:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
