(6575271, 979605, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not really seeing much macro or even a close up in this scene. I would certainly call it street photography, however. Perhaps the drinking glasses are intended to be the macro subject? If that''s the case, then the focus is on the wrong part of the scene and it''s too far away. Sorry, but I have to low vote this one, because I just can''t see how it fits.</td>', 'Not really seeing much macro or even a close up in this scene. I would certainly call it street photography, however. Perhaps the drinking glasses are intended to be the macro subject? If that''s the case, then the focus is on the wrong part of the scene and it''s too far away. Sorry, but I have to low vote this one, because I just can''t see how it fits.', '2011-10-24 14:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
