(6575484, 979834, 15711, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this, I had to really figure it out.  Nice going.</td>', 'When I first saw this, I had to really figure it out.  Nice going.', '2011-10-24 19:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6575485, 980109, 15711, '<td valign="top">You can''t go wrong with a kitty. :)</td>', 'You can''t go wrong with a kitty. :)', '2011-10-24 19:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6575487, 980065, 15711, '<td valign="top">LOL  Love your sense of humor.</td>', 'LOL  Love your sense of humor.', '2011-10-24 19:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6575511, 979673, 126903, '<td valign="top">OMG.. this looks like its been going on for some time.looking forward to finding out where this is.</td>', 'OMG.. this looks like its been going on for some time.looking forward to finding out where this is.', '2011-10-24 19:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6575567, 980113, 57447, '<td valign="top">Good fit, well done.</td>', 'Good fit, well done.', '2011-10-24 22:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6575689, 979841, 60173, '<td valign="top">Did he actually eat it? I''ve got a theory that squirrels are stealing my strawberries every year!</td>', 'Did he actually eat it? I''ve got a theory that squirrels are stealing my strawberries every year!', '2011-10-25 05:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6575742, 979695, 73942, '<td valign="top">one of the better entries, i love the oil slick background against the yellow leaf</td>', 'one of the better entries, i love the oil slick background against the yellow leaf', '2011-10-25 08:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6575751, 979715, 69324, '<td valign="top">Good catch, very docile expression in his eyes.</td>', 'Good catch, very docile expression in his eyes.', '2011-10-25 09:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6575755, 980032, 69324, '<td valign="top">Nice catch, in the true spirit of the challenge.</td>', 'Nice catch, in the true spirit of the challenge.', '2011-10-25 09:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6575757, 980060, 10785, '<td valign="top">This shot has the street vibe going for it. This shot has a classic composition with a good leading line and use of rhythm and repetition! The image quality is a little off. It is kind of soft and suffers from camera shake or something to that effect. I don''t know how to accurately describe this effect but it has the look of a video capture instead of a photo. I see that sometimes in digital photography but don''t know how to explain it.</td>', 'This shot has the street vibe going for it. This shot has a classic composition with a good leading line and use of rhythm and repetition! The image quality is a little off. It is kind of soft and suffers from camera shake or something to that effect. I don''t know how to accurately describe this effect but it has the look of a video capture instead of a photo. I see that sometimes in digital photography but don''t know how to explain it.', '2011-10-25 09:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6575758, 980114, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think this is a wonderful example of street macro in my small investigation of the genre. You got the reflection showing the street and a great close up! Nice and sharp and crisp in the details. Good processing!</td>', 'I think this is a wonderful example of street macro in my small investigation of the genre. You got the reflection showing the street and a great close up! Nice and sharp and crisp in the details. Good processing!', '2011-10-25 09:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6575759, 979839, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great example of street macro IMO. a detail of a sign that is definitely associated with street. Gritty and edgy processing give it more of the street vibe!</td>', 'Great example of street macro IMO. a detail of a sign that is definitely associated with street. Gritty and edgy processing give it more of the street vibe!', '2011-10-25 09:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6575760, 980113, 10785, '<td valign="top">In my investigation of street macro I found that there were two appropriate ways to shoot this genre. This is a great example of one of the ways. Focusing on a close up abject in the foreground of a street scene. Great execution. Gritty and edgy processing adds to the street vibe here!</td>', 'In my investigation of street macro I found that there were two appropriate ways to shoot this genre. This is a great example of one of the ways. Focusing on a close up abject in the foreground of a street scene. Great execution. Gritty and edgy processing adds to the street vibe here!', '2011-10-25 09:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6575761, 979889, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think you did well here!</td>', 'I think you did well here!', '2011-10-25 09:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6575762, 979605, 10785, '<td valign="top">In my investigation of street macro, I found two ways to shoot the genre. One was an extreme close up of a street related object. Another was to place a subject close up in the frame and fill the background with that typical street view. I think you have attempted the second method here. You used the tea and water glasses as  your close up but the focus is really on the ladies in the background. You did great with the gritty and edgy processing here though and captured a fine street scene.</td>', 'In my investigation of street macro, I found two ways to shoot the genre. One was an extreme close up of a street related object. Another was to place a subject close up in the frame and fill the background with that typical street view. I think you have attempted the second method here. You used the tea and water glasses as  your close up but the focus is really on the ladies in the background. You did great with the gritty and edgy processing here though and captured a fine street scene.', '2011-10-25 09:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6575763, 979933, 10785, '<td valign="top">In my investigation into street macro I found there were two ways to shoot this genre. One was to shoot a found object in the street close up. Your shot fits this typical view. I think this fits the challenge well enough. There were several reasons I voted this a 5. The photo has somewhat of a difficult perspective. It is shot close up to fit the challenge, but not close enough to have a great impact. The lighting is kind of bland and grey. You do have a nice pop of color in your subject but the impact of that color is swallowed up by the dull background.</td>', 'In my investigation into street macro I found there were two ways to shoot this genre. One was to shoot a found object in the street close up. Your shot fits this typical view. I think this fits the challenge well enough. There were several reasons I voted this a 5. The photo has somewhat of a difficult perspective. It is shot close up to fit the challenge, but not close enough to have a great impact. The lighting is kind of bland and grey. You do have a nice pop of color in your subject but the impact of that color is swallowed up by the dull background.', '2011-10-25 09:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6575807, 980133, 69324, '<td valign="top">Bonus point for title.</td>', 'Bonus point for title.', '2011-10-25 11:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6575838, 979577, 139850, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture. The texture looks great and the end of the stripe marks the perfect center of interest.</td>', 'Excellent picture. The texture looks great and the end of the stripe marks the perfect center of interest.', '2011-10-25 12:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6575840, 979609, 139850, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph. The Color and the way its sitting on the water makes the photo look great. Definatly one of the best ive seen so far!</td>', 'Beautiful photograph. The Color and the way its sitting on the water makes the photo look great. Definatly one of the best ive seen so far!', '2011-10-25 12:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6575841, 979889, 139850, '<td valign="top">Very interesting picture. The color and darkness with the whol black and white look makes it look excellent especially with the blurring people in the background!</td>', 'Very interesting picture. The color and darkness with the whol black and white look makes it look excellent especially with the blurring people in the background!', '2011-10-25 12:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6575842, 979795, 139850, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot! It not only has the macro feel and look to it, but it has a leading lines composition to it as well leading our eyes into the far off scenery! And the black and white is like the cherry on top!</td>', 'This is a great shot! It not only has the macro feel and look to it, but it has a leading lines composition to it as well leading our eyes into the far off scenery! And the black and white is like the cherry on top!', '2011-10-25 12:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6575843, 980065, 139850, '<td valign="top">Love this pic! Funny and unique. Its not just another "macro" shot, it has its own place on the podium from my perspective!</td>', 'Love this pic! Funny and unique. Its not just another "macro" shot, it has its own place on the podium from my perspective!', '2011-10-25 13:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6575845, 980004, 139850, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and lighting! The feel and texture that is photo gives is great! The angle also gave it a great touch! Good job!</td>', 'Excellent composition and lighting! The feel and texture that is photo gives is great! The angle also gave it a great touch! Good job!', '2011-10-25 13:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6575857, 979605, 100831, '<td valign="top">somebody didn''t understand the challenge. No vote.</td>', 'somebody didn''t understand the challenge. No vote.', '2011-10-25 13:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
