(6576131, 980065, 57447, '<td valign="top">Eye-catching.</td>', 'Eye-catching.', '2011-10-25 22:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576132, 979997, 57447, '<td valign="top">Neat street stuff.</td>', 'Neat street stuff.', '2011-10-25 22:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576134, 979900, 57447, '<td valign="top">Nice, love the rhythm.</td>', 'Nice, love the rhythm.', '2011-10-25 22:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576136, 980083, 57447, '<td valign="top">Street enough for me.</td>', 'Street enough for me.', '2011-10-25 22:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576340, 979715, 30982, '<td valign="top">Why did the grasshopper cross the road?  I''m thinking there must be a chicken in this story somewhere...</td>', 'Why did the grasshopper cross the road?  I''m thinking there must be a chicken in this story somewhere...', '2011-10-26 01:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576368, 980083, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh how I love this.  It''s so in-your-face.  Loud and alive!</td>', 'Oh how I love this.  It''s so in-your-face.  Loud and alive!', '2011-10-26 01:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576377, 979803, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not sure why, but this made me laugh.</td>', 'Not sure why, but this made me laugh.', '2011-10-26 01:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576378, 979237, 30982, '<td valign="top">A slight sense of impending doom.... nice.</td>', 'A slight sense of impending doom.... nice.', '2011-10-26 01:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576385, 979900, 30982, '<td valign="top">Dang, Paul, this looks good!</td>', 'Dang, Paul, this looks good!', '2011-10-26 01:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576827, 979950, 114225, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been more powerful if you cropped the bottom out.</td>', 'I think this could have been more powerful if you cropped the bottom out.', '2011-10-26 12:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576829, 979579, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m not seeing this photo as a macro or even extreme close up. It has a cool mood to it, I''m just not sure that it really fits into the challenge.</td>', 'I''m not seeing this photo as a macro or even extreme close up. It has a cool mood to it, I''m just not sure that it really fits into the challenge.', '2011-10-26 12:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576831, 979984, 114225, '<td valign="top">I wish all weeds looked this nice.</td>', 'I wish all weeds looked this nice.', '2011-10-26 12:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576832, 979695, 114225, '<td valign="top">Is that oil on the street? It sure makes for an interesting photo.</td>', 'Is that oil on the street? It sure makes for an interesting photo.', '2011-10-26 12:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576833, 979609, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow, so many colors in a single leaf.</td>', 'Wow, so many colors in a single leaf.', '2011-10-26 12:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576837, 980032, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great job highlighting the character of these shoes.</td>', 'Great job highlighting the character of these shoes.', '2011-10-26 12:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576849, 979993, 93565, '<td valign="top">Cliche but nicely captured. I like how the curve of the stem is mirrored in the leaf itself.</td>', 'Cliche but nicely captured. I like how the curve of the stem is mirrored in the leaf itself.', '2011-10-26 13:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576850, 979535, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like how much the subject is lurking within the frame, hiding in that sea of green. Pleasing composition. One of my favorites in voting so far.</td>', 'I like how much the subject is lurking within the frame, hiding in that sea of green. Pleasing composition. One of my favorites in voting so far.', '2011-10-26 13:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576854, 980101, 93565, '<td valign="top">You''ve done a great job abstracting things. I wonder if BW would make this even more abstract. Perhaps you wondered the same and thought voters would appreciate it less that way, but I think it might make the image all the more poignant if we stare death in the eye and don''t even know it.<br/>Interesting shot, I enjoy it.</td>', 'You''ve done a great job abstracting things. I wonder if BW would make this even more abstract. Perhaps you wondered the same and thought voters would appreciate it less that way, but I think it might make the image all the more poignant if we stare death in the eye and don''t even know it.Interesting shot, I enjoy it.', '2011-10-26 13:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576857, 979577, 93565, '<td valign="top">Nice textures in the paint and the asphalt.</td>', 'Nice textures in the paint and the asphalt.', '2011-10-26 13:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576858, 980081, 93565, '<td valign="top">Ah, very good! One of the few shots I would really say are macro, and a mostly untouched subject to boot!<br/>Nice job.</td>', 'Ah, very good! One of the few shots I would really say are macro, and a mostly untouched subject to boot!Nice job.', '2011-10-26 13:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576862, 980023, 93565, '<td valign="top">Glorious dilapidation. I like how this is largely abstracted from the line segment itself, made into something entirely separate.</td>', 'Glorious dilapidation. I like how this is largely abstracted from the line segment itself, made into something entirely separate.', '2011-10-26 13:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576866, 979963, 93565, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit underexposed overall to me. These shots always make me wonder if they are found or produced, but I generally like them in any case, though I always hope they''re stumbled upon, the photographer walking along staring at the ground.</td>', 'Looks a bit underexposed overall to me. These shots always make me wonder if they are found or produced, but I generally like them in any case, though I always hope they''re stumbled upon, the photographer walking along staring at the ground.', '2011-10-26 13:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576906, 979849, 93565, '<td valign="top">I think I know what you''re going for, but there is nothing dynamic or moving about this shot. It is completely still- next time consider having the person pause mid-stride instead of flatfooted on both feet.</td>', 'I think I know what you''re going for, but there is nothing dynamic or moving about this shot. It is completely still- next time consider having the person pause mid-stride instead of flatfooted on both feet.', '2011-10-26 13:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576914, 979605, 2337, '<td valign="top">Composition left me feeling crowded.  The top of one head, the left arm of the woman on the right, the bottom of the glasses were all cut off.  the space on the left edge seemed almost wasted and what I thought were your subjects were cramed into the space they had.  Felt kind of unbalanced.  <br/> <br/>That make sense?</td>', 'Composition left me feeling crowded.  The top of one head, the left arm of the woman on the right, the bottom of the glasses were all cut off.  the space on the left edge seemed almost wasted and what I thought were your subjects were cramed into the space they had.  Felt kind of unbalanced.   That make sense?', '2011-10-26 13:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576930, 979960, 118154, '<td valign="top">Like it.</td>', 'Like it.', '2011-10-26 13:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576931, 979900, 118154, '<td valign="top">Get down low and there we have it.</td>', 'Get down low and there we have it.', '2011-10-26 14:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576932, 980041, 118154, '<td valign="top">Lovin these low down shots.</td>', 'Lovin these low down shots.', '2011-10-26 14:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6576934, 979889, 118154, '<td valign="top">Great for this challenge.</td>', 'Great for this challenge.', '2011-10-26 14:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577215, 980035, 139906, '<td valign="top">Very well done, I love it.</td>', 'Very well done, I love it.', '2011-10-26 19:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577313, 979579, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice tense atmosphere intensified by the mercury (?) lighting. Good of you to get down low and show us some textures and detail.</td>', 'Nice tense atmosphere intensified by the mercury (?) lighting. Good of you to get down low and show us some textures and detail.', '2011-10-26 22:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577315, 979649, 76335, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea perhaps too overworked in processing.</td>', 'Interesting idea perhaps too overworked in processing.', '2011-10-26 22:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577316, 979835, 76335, '<td valign="top">Yikes! Is that a nostril?</td>', 'Yikes! Is that a nostril?', '2011-10-26 22:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577317, 979795, 76335, '<td valign="top">A landscape within a landscape. Great idea.</td>', 'A landscape within a landscape. Great idea.', '2011-10-26 22:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577318, 979892, 76335, '<td valign="top">Dark humor down low. Nice.</td>', 'Dark humor down low. Nice.', '2011-10-26 22:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577319, 979983, 76335, '<td valign="top">Interesting point of view.</td>', 'Interesting point of view.', '2011-10-26 22:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577321, 979577, 76335, '<td valign="top">Concrete canvas. Sehr nett.</td>', 'Concrete canvas. Sehr nett.', '2011-10-26 22:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577322, 980133, 76335, '<td valign="top">Indeed! Wonderful layers upon gritty layers.</td>', 'Indeed! Wonderful layers upon gritty layers.', '2011-10-26 22:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577323, 980047, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice details in this one. My own inclination would have been an overhead view, but shots like this help me to think outside the proverbial box.</td>', 'Nice details in this one. My own inclination would have been an overhead view, but shots like this help me to think outside the proverbial box.', '2011-10-26 22:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577325, 979930, 76335, '<td valign="top">Delicious!</td>', 'Delicious!', '2011-10-26 22:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577327, 980088, 76335, '<td valign="top">Interesting arrangement of limbs and shapes. Good in black and white. Sharpening is turned up a bit high.</td>', 'Interesting arrangement of limbs and shapes. Good in black and white. Sharpening is turned up a bit high.', '2011-10-26 22:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577328, 980076, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and complementary textures.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and complementary textures.', '2011-10-26 22:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577347, 980027, 60698, '<td valign="top">Excellent find! Detailed and unique. I like that you can see a fisheye, mini view of what is behind you.</td>', 'Excellent find! Detailed and unique. I like that you can see a fisheye, mini view of what is behind you.', '2011-10-26 23:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577395, 980114, 139897, '<td valign="top">like the sharpness against the blur and the colours...this is my favourite for this challenge</td>', 'like the sharpness against the blur and the colours...this is my favourite for this challenge', '2011-10-27 00:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577449, 980004, 35229, '<td valign="top">So nice. To bad that I cant vote :)</td>', 'So nice. To bad that I cant vote :)', '2011-10-27 03:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577450, 979960, 35229, '<td valign="top">So good!</td>', 'So good!', '2011-10-27 03:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577451, 979993, 35229, '<td valign="top">Wow!</td>', 'Wow!', '2011-10-27 03:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577452, 979691, 35229, '<td valign="top">Selective saturation on those feet. Like this they just blend in with the street.</td>', 'Selective saturation on those feet. Like this they just blend in with the street.', '2011-10-27 03:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577521, 979827, 2337, '<td valign="top">My eye just kind of wanders aimlessly around this shot.  Not drawn anywhere.  I can''t really identify most of what''s here (is that an ice cube?) so the title is completely lost on me.</td>', 'My eye just kind of wanders aimlessly around this shot.  Not drawn anywhere.  I can''t really identify most of what''s here (is that an ice cube?) so the title is completely lost on me.', '2011-10-27 09:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577523, 980091, 2337, '<td valign="top">Couldn''t identify anything as the subject... The light patch near the center?  the "sunny" patch in the upper right kept drawing my eye away.  If that patch near the center was where you wanted me looking,  it may have helped to employ the rule of thirds to some degree. I tryed viewing it strictly as an abstract but again my eye wandered aimlessly.<br/> <br/>Hope that makes sense.</td>', 'Couldn''t identify anything as the subject... The light patch near the center?  the "sunny" patch in the upper right kept drawing my eye away.  If that patch near the center was where you wanted me looking,  it may have helped to employ the rule of thirds to some degree. I tryed viewing it strictly as an abstract but again my eye wandered aimlessly. Hope that makes sense.', '2011-10-27 09:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577524, 979986, 2337, '<td valign="top">Love this... Nice range of tones, composition spot on, a definite 10<br/> <br/>Congrats on a great image</td>', 'Love this... Nice range of tones, composition spot on, a definite 10 Congrats on a great image', '2011-10-27 09:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577525, 979893, 2337, '<td valign="top">The diagonal shadow, the texture, composition... A pure 10<br/> <br/>Congrats on a great shot</td>', 'The diagonal shadow, the texture, composition... A pure 10 Congrats on a great shot', '2011-10-27 09:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577526, 979695, 2337, '<td valign="top">Love this one.  Who would have thought an oil slick could be so nice.  Makes me want to go spill oil all over the street :)<br/> <br/>But seriously, excellent capture!  Great composition, lighting, the whole 9 yards.  A pure 10<br/> <br/>Grats on a great capture</td>', 'Love this one.  Who would have thought an oil slick could be so nice.  Makes me want to go spill oil all over the street :) But seriously, excellent capture!  Great composition, lighting, the whole 9 yards.  A pure 10 Grats on a great capture', '2011-10-27 09:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577906, 980048, 135874, '<td valign="top">Too blurry.</td>', 'Too blurry.', '2011-10-27 20:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577907, 980099, 135874, '<td valign="top">Maybe would have been more interesting in color?</td>', 'Maybe would have been more interesting in color?', '2011-10-27 20:25:25.000000', NULL, 1);
