(6578838, 979877, 64733, '<td valign="top">Very nice exposure and contrast.  I like that the green is so vibrant.  The yellow thorn in front is a little distracting, but I understand you need to capture what''s given to you.</td>', 'Very nice exposure and contrast.  I like that the green is so vibrant.  The yellow thorn in front is a little distracting, but I understand you need to capture what''s given to you.', '2011-10-29 10:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578839, 979584, 64733, '<td valign="top">Wear pants next time!  j/k  Nice image and cool idea.</td>', 'Wear pants next time!  j/k  Nice image and cool idea.', '2011-10-29 10:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
