(6578862, 979513, 104230, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and shapes.  I''m curious why you chose such a shallow DOF, as I find the out of focus areas distracting, perhaps because the bright yellow draws my eye to those areas.  Interestingly, my reaction to this issue varies by how close I am to my monitor.  When I move further away than my usual position it does not bother me as much. Going to bump this!</td>', 'Love the colors and shapes.  I''m curious why you chose such a shallow DOF, as I find the out of focus areas distracting, perhaps because the bright yellow draws my eye to those areas.  Interestingly, my reaction to this issue varies by how close I am to my monitor.  When I move further away than my usual position it does not bother me as much. Going to bump this!', '2011-10-29 11:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
