(6580216, 980004, 114969, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tome:</b></div><hr/><i> Gorgeous. Love the elongated car. Out of curiosity - at f/16, is the funny blur a result of the TS, or is it more due to processing? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you! About the blur, it is simply due to the fact the focus was set to the shortest distance (0.25m). The lens was almost not tilted, so I don''t think it''s due to that. Also, no blur was added in post-processing. Fun lens, love it :)</td>', 'Originally posted by tome: Gorgeous. Love the elongated car. Out of curiosity - at f/16, is the funny blur a result of the TS, or is it more due to processing?   Thank you! About the blur, it is simply due to the fact the focus was set to the shortest distance (0.25m). The lens was almost not tilted, so I don''t think it''s due to that. Also, no blur was added in post-processing. Fun lens, love it :)', '2011-10-31 17:35:16.000000', NULL, 0),
