(6581137, 980133, 30364, '<td valign="top">Witty and absorbing.  An uncompromising sort of audacity in refusing to give this a conventional frame of human reference, such as an encroaching footprint or shadow or even a bit of human detritus like a cigarette butt or discarded wrapper. It''s all the better for that restraint.  I voted this in my top three but neglected to comment because I was just reaching for the reins after a break from DPC.  I''m resuscitating the ancient and dishonorable Award of The Thumb.  Thank you.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=197649" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/354/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_197649.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/354/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_197649.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/354/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_197649.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Witty and absorbing.  An uncompromising sort of audacity in refusing to give this a conventional frame of human reference, such as an encroaching footprint or shadow or even a bit of human detritus like a cigarette butt or discarded wrapper. It''s all the better for that restraint.  I voted this in my top three but neglected to comment because I was just reaching for the reins after a break from DPC.  I''m resuscitating the ancient and dishonorable Award of The Thumb.  Thank you.', '2011-11-01 11:21:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6581143, 979839, 30364, '<td valign="top">This was in my top three for its simple but surprisingly elegant typology.  I grant you the little-admired Order of the Thumb.  Arise, and thank you.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=197649" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/354/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_197649.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/354/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_197649.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/354/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_197649.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This was in my top three for its simple but surprisingly elegant typology.  I grant you the little-admired Order of the Thumb.  Arise, and thank you.', '2011-11-01 11:28:36.000000', NULL, 0),
