(6581148, 980113, 30364, '<td valign="top">Among my top three picks for its whimsy as well as its remarkable, unexpected beauty.  There''s a lot more to relish here than just the very clever titular reference.  Please accept an Order of the Thumb, and thanks for all the fish.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=197649" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/354/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_197649.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/354/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_197649.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/354/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_197649.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Among my top three picks for its whimsy as well as its remarkable, unexpected beauty.  There''s a lot more to relish here than just the very clever titular reference.  Please accept an Order of the Thumb, and thanks for all the fish.', '2011-11-01 11:32:48.000000', NULL, 0),
