(6662806, 979554, 28742, '<td valign="top">...what do I win? ;-)<br/> <br/>I didn''t score this one during the challenge. If I had, woulda been a six. It''s technically excellent, but doesn''t scream street macro and has only moderate interest to me. ...says the guy who entered a <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=980022" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">cigarette butt.</a> :) I like the color and certainly the DoF though.</td>', '...what do I win? ;-) I didn''t score this one during the challenge. If I had, woulda been a six. It''s technically excellent, but doesn''t scream street macro and has only moderate interest to me. ...says the guy who entered a cigarette butt. :) I like the color and certainly the DoF though.', '2012-02-03 05:54:11.000000', NULL, 0),
