(6663058, 979554, 77196, '<td valign="top">No comments - probably because it comes across as a meh picture. It soft-of falls into the "What is it?" category, and with the word being mostly upside down, requires some effort and thought to figure out. Then, there is no real relation between the word and the image.<br/>For me, the technicals are good, but there is no clear meaning or message, so it is hard to relate to. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-02-03 11:40:30.</i></td>', 'No comments - probably because it comes across as a meh picture. It soft-of falls into the "What is it?" category, and with the word being mostly upside down, requires some effort and thought to figure out. Then, there is no real relation between the word and the image.For me, the technicals are good, but there is no clear meaning or message, so it is hard to relate to. ', '2012-02-03 11:39:27.000000', '2012-02-03 11:40:30.000000', 0),
