(6825954, 979695, 48228, '<td valign="top">I LOVE LOVE LOVE THIS SO SO MUCH LOVE IT... I ALWAYS HAD A LOVE OF THE WAY OIL LOOKS RE THE LUSTRE COLOURS ON THE PAVEMENT OR ON THE BITUMEN ROADS... THIS IS AN AWESOME IMAGE AND MISSED IF]T SOMEHOW AS THIS IS MY FIRST VIEWING OF IT...<br/> <br/>I GIVEN GIT MY <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=48228" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">SHERPET</a> JEWEL AWARD OF EXCELLENCE AS I LOVE THE RICH COLORS THE TEXTURES AND THE IDEA ITSELF.<br/> <br/>FROM SHEZ<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/48228/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1025373.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/48228/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1025373.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/48228/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1025373.jpg"/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'I LOVE LOVE LOVE THIS SO SO MUCH LOVE IT... I ALWAYS HAD A LOVE OF THE WAY OIL LOOKS RE THE LUSTRE COLOURS ON THE PAVEMENT OR ON THE BITUMEN ROADS... THIS IS AN AWESOME IMAGE AND MISSED IF]T SOMEHOW AS THIS IS MY FIRST VIEWING OF IT... I GIVEN GIT MY  SHERPET JEWEL AWARD OF EXCELLENCE AS I LOVE THE RICH COLORS THE TEXTURES AND THE IDEA ITSELF. FROM SHEZ   ', '2012-07-24 02:16:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6837857, 980020, 139873, '<td valign="top">I think any vote below a 4 should require explanation on this site!  This is photo got my attention for over ten minutes!  There is a marking below the eye, almost looks like a wound as well as what loos like blood above the eyelid.  The strong local contrast makes the hair look like small porcupine quills.  The animal must be lying down in this shot (from your reflection in the eye), which adds a feeling of submission.  I cant help pointing out an interesting and often overlook functional pattern in nature: hair follicles have such a per-determined flow, especially around the eye.  Your photo does a great job showing this detail.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-08-08 10:42:05.</i></td>', 'I think any vote below a 4 should require explanation on this site!  This is photo got my attention for over ten minutes!  There is a marking below the eye, almost looks like a wound as well as what loos like blood above the eyelid.  The strong local contrast makes the hair look like small porcupine quills.  The animal must be lying down in this shot (from your reflection in the eye), which adds a feeling of submission.  I cant help pointing out an interesting and often overlook functional pattern in nature: hair follicles have such a per-determined flow, especially around the eye.  Your photo does a great job showing this detail.', '2012-08-08 11:40:26.000000', '2012-08-08 11:42:05.000000', 0),
